<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">James</book>
  <para style="h">James</para>
  <para style="toc1">James</para>
  <para style="toc2">James</para>
  <para style="mt">James</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien le Topa Jesu Khris’ nasem khat ahi keima James in, a kithethang Judah minam sawm le nite: kang hopi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka sanggamte aw, thuhahsa nam khatpopo na tuo sielun bangma-in sim sih unlen, kipahna-in tuot zaw un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />azieh pen na upna uh ang kisittelna in thuohzawhna a piengsah hi, ci na thei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />bangma lawsapna nei loin, a picing le a cingtah na suo thei nadingun thuohzawhna in a bukimin semsah suoh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note lahah mi khatpo in pilna a kitasap leh koima hosie loin mi zosie tungah vau taha a pie Pasien kungah ngen heh, tua hile kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in lunghei nei loin upna tawh ngen taheh, bangzieh ahei cile lunghei nei mite pen hui in a mut cienga a kilawh kawikawi tuihuol tawh kibang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile lunghei nei mi, sepna bangkimah a lungkaa mi le lungkip a nei lo mipa in Topa kung panin na khatpo a nga dingin kilamen vet sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A neilut thu um mi pa a kitawisang ziehin kisathei heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihaute a kiniemkhieh suh ciengin lungdam lel uheh, bangzieh ahei cile mihaute zong gamlah paape bangin a mangthai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen a satna tawh ni ang suo ciengin leitang gawtasah hi; a paate pulin a mel hoina teng a tulmang hi; mihaute zong tua bang ma ahi uhi; amate sumbawlin a kitala laitahun a vulmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ze-etna a thuoh zo mi poma mi hampha ahi hi. Tua bang mipa in ze-etna a thuoh zaw ciengin Topa in ama a it mite tungah a na kamciemsa hinna lukhu a nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi khat a kize-et ciengin, “Pasien in kei ei ze-et hi,” ci sih heh; azieh pen gitlona tawh Pasien kize-et thei lo a, amama in koima a ze-et sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi khat’ lunggulna in ama zawlin a kai ciengin ze-etna a thuoh ahi bo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua ciengin tua lunggulna gai-in mawna piengsah a, tua mawna ang khangliet ciengin sina a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka itte aw, mite solin om sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Deisahna tawh piehkhietna nasep vannuoi le a bukim letsong vannuoi pen tunglam pana ang pei ahi a, kikhelna nei loin ni hlim kihei bangin a kihei kawikawi lo khuovahte’ Pa kung pana ang kumsuh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama’ piensahte lahah ga masa pente i suo thei nading le ama’ lungtup a tangtun thei nadingin thuman thutah tawh ei piengsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka itte aw, tami thu thei ta un: A koimapo thungai ding mallang hinlen, kamham ding ahi a, lungthah ding ahi zongin kiheh heh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />azieh pen note’ lungthahna in Pasien’ dihtatna a piengsah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a kidahhuoi gamtatna zosie le a valkai gitlonate paimang unlen, note’ hlagaute ang hunkhie thei na sung vua a kisuonsa thu lungnem tahin na sang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanle noma le noma kisolin a za maimaite hi sih unlen, na zah uh thu bangin a gamtate hizaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen mi khatpo in thu za napi thu banga a gamtat sih leh ama pen hlimlangah ama’ maitang a ki-en mipa tawh kibang ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />azieh pen ama le ama a ki-et zaw ciengin peikhie a, ama bang tawh kibang ahei ci a mangngil pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin a bucing suotahna thukham limtahin enin zui suoh a, za-in a mangngil mi hi loin, sepna tawh a zah thu a zui mi in a sepna-ah thupha nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi khatpo in biehna mi ka hi hi, ci napi a leii a kep siem sih leh ama le ama kisol hi lel a, ama’ biehna in kimanna a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pa Pasien mai-ah a siengtho le a buabang lo biehna i ci in: Tagate le meigong meithaite’ hahsatnate ah va kep va khoi ding le leitung’ buana panin kikoicing ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka sanggamte aw, na mi deidan kawmpi ma-un a minthang i Topa Jesu a um tahtah ma na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen na kikhopna sung vuah kham khutsip bun puonhoi sil khat le mizawng puonsie sil khat ang peiton uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />puonhoi sil pa limbawl deu-in, “Tana tona ah hing to in,” na ci vua, tua laitahin mizawng pa kungah “Tuanah na ding phot in,” ahi sihle, “Ka keng gei-ah hing to in,” na tuomci uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />no le no sungah kideidanna bawl na hi vua, tuaci’n note pen gitlona lungsim tawh thukhente suoh hi ta lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kang it sanggamte aw, ngai un. Pasien in leitungah mizawngte pen upna lamah a hau ding le ama a it mite tunga a kamciemsa kumpi gam a luote ahi dingin teel zo hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in mizawngte na simmaw bawl uhi. No ang gawtte, mihaute hi lo uh amah? Thukhenna zumah ang kaite zong amate hi lo uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note ang kiphuo min ngaipen a gensiete zong amate ma hi lo uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lai Siengtho sungah “Nangma na ki-it bangin na vengte na it ding hi,” a ci dung zui-in thukham lienpi na zui zo tahpi uleh a hoi sep na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in deidanna na nei uleh mawna bawl na hi vua, thukham palsatte ma bangin note zong thukham in maw ang tangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mi khat in thukham zosie a zui sieng vangin khat a zuila leh a unpi-in a khiel ma hi veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen, “Ang kawm sin,” a ci mipa in, “Tuol that sin,” zong ci hi. Ang na kawm sih vangin tuol na tha leh thukham palsat khat ma na hi veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n suotahna thukham in thu a khen ding mite bangin thu genin gamta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen khuotuona a nei lo mi poma tungah khuotuona om loin thu kikhen ding hi; khuotuona in thukhenna tungah a guolzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka sanggamte aw, mi khat in upna ka nei hi, a ci vangin gamtatna tawh a lah sih leh bang phattuomna om ding ahei? Upna in ang hundam zo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sanggam pa khat ahi sihle sanggam nu khat in sil ding puon nei loin nisiel a neh ding an tasam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuale note khatpo in amau’ pumpi kitasapna bangma pie lo pi-in amate kungah, “Nuom tahin na pei un; na khuo uh lumin na gilva un,” mawh ci locin bang phattuomna om ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n gamtatna a nei lo upna guoh pen a si ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanle mi pawlkhatte in, “Nang in upna na nei a, ke’n gamtatna ka nei hi,” ci ding uhi. Na gamtatna in a zui lo na upna ei lah inlen, ke’n ka gamtatna tawh ka upna kang lah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasien khat beh om hi, ci na um uhi; na hoi sep hi. Dawite nangawn in umin zau-in a ling uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang mimaw pa aw, gamtatna in a zui lo upna a si ahi lam ang kilah ding na dei ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I pupi uh ahi Abraham in maitam tungah a tapa Isaac a na pieh lai-in gamtatna tawh dih na tang hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Upna in a gamtatna tawh na semton a, gamtatna in upna kicingsah hi, ci note in na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Lai Siengtho sungah, “Abraham in Pasien um a, tua khu ama tungah dihna-in a kisimpieh hi,” a ci thu ang tangtung ta a, ama pen Pasien’ lawmpa kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Upna beh tawh hi loin gamtatna tawh mi khat dih kitangsah hi, ci thu note in na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ma bangin numei pahtat Rahab in zong thukante zin tungsahin lampi dang khatah a sawlkhiet hun lai-in, a gamtatna ziehin dih kitangsah hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Azieh pen hlagau om lo pumpi a si ahi ma bangin gamtatna om lo upna zong a si ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka sanggamte aw, thu a hil kote pen a khauzaw-in thu ei kikhen ding ahi ziehin note tampi zong sie na suo sawm da mai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ei teng zosie in khielna tampi i bawl uhi. Mi khatpo in a thugenna-ah khielna a nei sih leh ama mi cingtah ahi a, a pumpi zosie a kemcing siem pa zong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sakolte in i thu a man thei nadingin a kam sung vuah kamkaih vaw leih a pumpi zosie uh i kiheisah thei kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi sihle tembawte en un: Tuate khu a gol mama a, huipi khauh mama in a mut vangin a hawlpa’ deina popo-ah a heina neuno khat tawh kihei kawikawi thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ma bangin leii zong i pumpi tungah a neu mama van khat hi napi thu lienpite-ah a kisathei mama hi. Meikuong neuno khat in gammang tulah katumsah thei hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale leii pen meikuong khat ma ahi hi. Tua leii pen i pumpi nate lahah gitlona lompi khat bangin kikoi hi; tua in i pumpi tung vannuoi buasahin i pienzie buppi mei tawh hal a, hell meikuong tawh ama le ama zong kihaltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile gamsa namcin, va namcin, a bawhva ganhingte le tuipi sunga ganhing namcin kikhawizuol thei a, mihingte in tuate na khawizuol zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanle leii pen a om ngim thei lo a gilo, si theina gu tawh kidim hi a, koima in zuolsah zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua leii tawh Topa le Pa i phat vua, tua leii ma tawh Pasien’ lim le mel suna a kibawl mihingte i samsie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kibang kam sung khat panin phatna le samsietna pusuoh ton hi. Ka sanggamte aw, tam bang ahi ding pen kilawm vawt lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuinah khat pan tuisieng le ciatui a pulton thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka sanggamte aw, theikung in olive ga-in, lengga gui panin thei a ga thei amah? Citui in tuisieng pulsah thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note lahah a pil le thuthei koi om ahei? Pilna pana a pieng nunnemna ziehin hinkhuo hoi tawh na sepnate uh ei lah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin na lungtang sung vuah a khalawng thangsietna le angsung khuolna lungsim na nei uleh thuman thutah tungah kisielin zuou sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua bang pilna pen a tunglam pana ang peisuh hi loin leitung pilna, cilesa pilna le dawi pilna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen kithangsietna le angsung khuolna a opna munah kilem lona le gitlona namcin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hizongle tunglam pana ang pei pilna in a masa penin siengtho a, tua zaw ciengin kilemna dei-in, nunnem a, thuman nopna nei-in, khuotuona le ga hoi tawh kidim a, deidanna om loin kineitawmna zong a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kilemna a bawlte adingin lungnuom taha a tu uh khaici panin dihna ga a at uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note lahah a om tua bang kidona le kihaunate hei pana ang pei ahei? Noma sunga gal a bawl den ahi lunggulna pana tuate ang pei hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na khatpo na deigaw vua, na nei tuom sih uhi; tuaci’n tuol na that uhi. Tuale na khat na deigaw vua, na nga zo sih uhi; tuaci’n kihau-in na kido uhi. Note in na nget lo ziehun na nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ngen vua, na nga sih uhi, azieh pen note in noptat nadingin na nget khiel ziehun na nga sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Angkawmte aw! Leitung tawh kilawmtatna pen Pasien tawh kigalneina ahi lam na thei sih uh amah? Tua ahi ziehin leitung tawh a kilawmta nuom poma Pasien’ gal a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi sihle Lai Siengtho in, “Ama in eite sunga ang tensah hlagau pen Pasien in ngai mama hi,” a ci khu bangma lo a na ngaisut uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hizongle ama in a lienzaw hepina ei pie a, tua ahi ziehin, “Pasien in a kisatheite do a, a kiniemkhiehte tungah hepina a pie hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin noma ma in Pasien’ thu na mang un. Dawimangpa na do un, tua hile na kung panun a taimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien kung neh un, tua hile ama in zong ang neh ding hi. No mawneite aw, na khut uh silsieng un, no a lungkaa mite aw, na lungtangte uh siensuo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Da-in kapin mau un. Na nuina uh dana suoh hinlen, na kipahna uh maigumna suoh taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa mai-ah noma le noma kiniemkhieh un, tua hile ama in note ang lamsang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, khatlekhat na kigensie sih un. Midang khat a gensie, ahi sihle midang khat tunga thu khen poma thukham gensie ahi a, thukham tunga thu khen ahi hi; thukham tunga thu na khen leh thukham zui pa na hi sih a, thukhen pa na hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ei hundam thei le ei susie thei thukham pie pa khat le thukhen pa khat a om hi. Tua ahile na veng pa tunga thu a khen nang koi hi viel na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tuni ahiei zingcieng ahiei khatin tanah ahi sihle tua khuopite ah pei-in tuanah kum khat sung tamin, van lei van zua-in sumbawlin sum va sui tavai,” a ci note aw, tu-in ka thugen ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zingcieng bang pieng ding ci thu na thei sih uhi. Na hinna uh bang hi lel ahei? Bang ding ahei cile note pen bano khat sung ang kilaa zaw cienga a thengkia pai tuikhu bang na hi lel bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note in, “ Topa’ awina a op leh eite nungta-in, tami ahiei khumi ahiei khat i sem ding hi,” na ci ding uh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua bangin kiphasahin na kisiel sih un; tua banga kisielnate zosie gitlona ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin mi khatpo in bang bawl leng a hoi diei ci thei napi-in a bawl sih leh mawna bawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />No mihaute aw, tu-in hing pei unlen note tunga ang tung ding hamsatnate ziehin kap in mau un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na haunate uh muotmangin, na puonsilte uh nget in netum sieng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ngun na khamte uh sam-eh kaisieng zo a, na lang vuah sam-eh teci hing pangin meikuong bangin na sa uh a ne ding hi. Note in ni nukhia ni adingin ngun le kham na khol zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai un! Note in solin a thaman na pieh lo uh, na lo uh ang hlawpieh nasemte a kiko vua, vanglien Topa bil ah anlate kikona tung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leitungah noptat zulzau-in na nungta vua, nuomsa-in gawlup ni adingin na kivathau phitphet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thu uh ang niel zo lo midih pa mawsahin na that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin it le ngaite aw, Topa ang pei dongin lungduoi tahin om un. Leitang pana ga manphate a nga thei nadingin lohlo pa in guo masa le guo nukhia a zuh dongin lungduoi tahin a ngah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />No zong na lungduoi un. Topa ang pei bai ta ding ahi ziehin na lungsimte uh na khausah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />It le ngaite aw, thukhenna na thuoh lo nadingun khatlekhat na kiphunsan sih un. En un, kotpi gei-ah Thukhen Pa a ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />It le ngaite aw, gimthuohna leh lungduoina lamah Topa’ min tawh thu a gen kamsangte ette-in na nei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tahtahin kote in a thuohzo mite mi hampha ahi hi, ka ci uhi. Note in Job’ thuohzawhna na za zo vua, tuaci’n Topa’ siltup le Topa’ in bangza tahin ama lungsietin khuotuo ahei ci zong na thei zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam teng zosie banah, kang itte aw, vantung tawh ahi a, leitung tawh ahi zongin adang kiciemna khatpo tawh na kiciem sih un. Mawsahna na thuoh lo nadingun, a hite, “Ahi,” ahi lote, “A hilo,” hisah pai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note lahah mi khatpo gimna thuoh a om eimah? Amate in thungen uheh. A lungdam mi khatpo a om ei mah? Amate in phatna la sa uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note lahah a cina mi khatpo a om eimah? Hlattuom pawlpi upate hlanin amate in thungetpieh uh hinlen, amate tungah Topa’ minin sathau nu uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Upna tawh thungetna in cinate damsah ding a, Topa in amate a phongto ding hi. Mawna a bawl mi khatpo zong a mawna kimaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na dam sieng thei nadingun khatlekhat na mawnate uh kipulah tuohin khatlekhat thu kingetpieh ciet un. Midihte’ thungetna in vang nei-in na lienpi sem thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elijah zong eite bangin mihing khat ma hi lel napi, guo a zuh lo nadingin nahpi tahin thungen a, tuaci’n kum thum le hlaguh sung leitungah guo zu loin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin thu a ngenkia leuleu leh vantung in guo zusahin leitung in galete a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka sanggamte aw, note lahah thuman thutah panin mi khatpo pielin, midang khat in tuapa ang nuatutkia leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a vahvaina panin mawnei mi khat a tunpikia poma in sina panin tua mawnei pa’ hlagau hundamin, mawna tampitah a selpieh ahi ding hi, ci thu tua mipa in thei taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
